WEBVTT

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.270
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.286 --> 00:00:09.198
<v><b>Marta:</b></v> I looked everywhere – in my bag, in my case – but it wasn’t there.

00:00:11.239 --> 00:00:11.913
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.986 --> 00:00:15.200
<v><b>Marta:</b></v> This happened two years ago.

00:00:17.146 --> 00:00:17.974
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:18.985 --> 00:00:22.897
<v><b>Marta:</b></v> I waited another five or six hours.